      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>A right triangle has legs \\( 5 \\) and \\( 12 \\). Find the hypotenuse.</p>\\[ \\sqrt{5^{2}+12^{2}}=\\sqrt{169}=13. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>In a \\( 30\\text{–}60\\text{–}90 \\) triangle the short leg is \\( 1 \\). Find the hypotenuse.</p><p>The hypotenuse is twice the short leg:</p>\\[ 2. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
